 "stimulus_html": "<figure id=\"Figure_13_02_MDemocracy\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/818df3fe43e3331b.png\" alt=\"Truman stands on a rug labeled “Civil Rights.” A crazy-looking woman, “Miss Democracy,” stands off the rug, looks angrily at Truman, and says “You mean you’d rather be right than president?”\">\n<figcaption>Political cartoon by Clifford Berryman regarding civil rights and the 1948 election.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
